.TH AVR\-ORG\-INSTALL\-RUNNER\-DELETE 1 "" "avr 0.5.0" "Avrea CLI"
.SH NAME
avr-org-install-runner-delete \- Remove MACHINE_TYPE's runner configuration from Avrea.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B avr org install runner delete
[OPTIONS] MACHINE_TYPE
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove MACHINE_TYPE's runner configuration from Avrea.
.PP
The runner object in GitLab remains for the group Owner to remove.
.PP
.RS 4
.nf
JSON FIELDS
    deleted, installation_id, machine_type
.fi
.RE
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
\fIMACHINE_TYPE\fR
\&
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-org\fR \fITEXT\fR
Organization ID or slug. Uses default org if not specified (see: avr config set org).
.TP
\fB\-\-installation\-id\fR \fITEXT\fR
GitLab installation ID (ins-xxx format). (required)
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR, \fB\-y\fR
Skip the confirmation prompt.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR \fITEXT\fR
Output JSON. Pass comma-separated field names, "*" for all fields, or "?" to list available fields.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-jq\fR \fITEXT\fR
Filter --json output through a jq expression.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR avr (1),
.BR avr-org-install-runner (1),
.BR avr-org-install-runner-create (1),
.BR avr-org-install-runner-list (1),
.BR avr-org-install-runner-set (1)
